%% Billing event lifecycle: the states a logged webhook event moves through, what moves it, and where an
%% operator steps in. Processor-agnostic. Only failed and dead_lettered count as problems.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: webhook logged
  pending --> pending: retry wait (30s to 30m)
  pending --> pending: stuck sweep re-enqueues (10 min)
  pending --> processed: adapter succeeded
  pending --> ignored: adapter ignored it
  pending --> alerted: adapter reported it for attention
  pending --> failed: adapter raised an error
  failed --> failed: retried by the job (up to 5 attempts)
  failed --> processed: a retry succeeded
  failed --> dead_lettered: hourly sweep, 5 attempts or 6 hours
  pending --> dead_lettered: hourly sweep, 6 hours without progress
  dead_lettered --> replayed: operator retry
  failed --> replayed: operator retry
  replayed --> processed: replay succeeded
  replayed --> failed: replay failed again
  processed --> [*]
  ignored --> [*]
  alerted --> [*]
